## 🚌 Bus Factor Analysis
Period: all | Generated: 2026-10-24

### Project-Level Bus Factor: 1

The project is small: one library file, `lib/index.js`, plus 6 test files. That file is the whole product. Its history has 25 authors, but Troy Goode wrote 29 of its 62 commits (47%). Most of the other authors made 1–4 commits each. The only way to keep the file's bus factor above 1 is to have more than one active maintainer who understands it.

### Overview

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| Source files analyzed | 7 (`.js`) |
| Files with bus factor 1 (one author ever) | 2 (29%), both trivial test helpers |
| Files with bus factor 2 | 1 (14%) |
| Files with bus factor 3+ | 4 (57%) |
| Files where one person has more than 80% of commits | 2 (`test/support/env.js`, `test/vary.js`, each with a single commit) |

### Critical Risk Areas

By raw author count, nothing here is a single-contributor risk. Ownership is concentrated by commit share and by who is still active:

| File | Primary contributor | Share | Active? | Dependents | Risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/index.js` | Troy Goode | 29/62 (47%) | ✅ Last commit 2026-04-10 | Every test file, plus `package.json` `main` | [MEDIUM] |
| `test/example-app.js`, `test/issue-2.js`, `test/error-response.js` | Troy Goode | 67–83% | ✅ Active | 0 | [LOW] |
| `test/test.js` | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 8/11 (73%) | ❌ Inactive since 2021-09 | 0 | [LOW] |
| `test/support/env.js` | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 100% (1 commit) | ❌ Inactive since 2021-09 | 0 | [LOW] |

### Knowledge Distribution by Module

| Module | Contributors | Primary owner | Ownership % | Bus factor |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/` | 25 | Troy Goode | 47% | 1–2 |
| `test/` | 1–4 per file | Troy Goode / Douglas Christopher Wilson | 67–100% | 1–2 |

### Knowledge Heat Map

```
repo/
├── lib/    [█████░░░░░] 🟡 Troy Goode 47% (active; Douglas Christopher Wilson 4 commits, inactive since 2021)
└── test/   [███████░░░] 🟡 Troy Goode / Douglas Christopher Wilson, small files, 1–4 authors each
```

### Whole-repo history

| Contributor | Commits | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 143 | ❌ Inactive since 2021-09 |
| Troy Goode | 95 | ✅ Active (2026-04) |
| dependabot[bot] | 11 | automation |
| Everyone else | 1–4 each | mostly one-off |

Since 2025-04, Troy Goode has made only 2 commits. The recent activity is mostly dependabot (11) and about 10 occasional contributors, each with 1–3 commits. Day-to-day maintenance is thin and spread across people who contribute rarely.

### Recommendations

1. **Immediate:** Name a second maintainer who reviews and merges changes to `lib/index.js`, so Troy Goode is not the only one who knows it.
2. **Short-term:** Document the intent behind the `lib/index.js` handlers and the history behind the issue-specific tests (`test/issue-2.js`). Douglas Christopher Wilson, the top committer overall, has been inactive for about 5 years, so his knowledge of the project is effectively lost.
3. **Ongoing:** Encourage the recent contributors (Ulises Gascón, Jon Church, and others) to take on reviews. Require a review on every change to `lib/`.

**Caveats:**
- Authors are counted by git name, so one person with several names or emails would be counted as several.
- With only 7 files, the per-file percentages come from very few commits, so treat them as indicative rather than precise.
- I counted dependents by hand. Only `lib/index.js` has any, and those are the test files.

